{'symbol': 'GPC', 'date': '2021-04-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'GENUINE PARTS COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "ATLANTA, APRIL 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENUINE PARTS COMPANY (NYSE: GPC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF EIGHTY-ONE AND ONE-HALF\xa0CENTS ($0.815) PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 1, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD JUNE 4, 2021."}